n where lightning strikes unusually often. Lightning-struck trees and lightning rods are scattered all across the mountain. What adventures await you on this dangerous, unfamiliar mountain?A Secretive Village Wary of OutsidersDeep within Noec","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T01:47:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067942644","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:56:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4671450-1842846814452452","game_id":"steam-4671450","kind":"announcement","title":"Upcoming News & Demo Bug Notice","summary":"Upcoming News & Demo Bug NoticeHello, this is the World of Slime.Thank you sincerely to everyone who has enjoyed the game so passionately since the demo launch. We have several updates to share with you. Noecheon Village - Opening in Early OctoberReflecting the valuable feedback you've all shared, Noecheon Village is scheduled to open in early October along with a variety of improvements. We're carefully reviewing every single piece of feedback left during the demo period, and we'll continue to ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-07T08:07:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814452452","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:56:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4671450-1842212951296182","game_id":"steam-4671450","kind":"announcement","title":"The 'World of Slime' Demo Open!","summary":"Be the first to set off and meet these chewy, gooey friends.🫧Don't miss your chance to claim your very own nickname, too!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-26T08:37:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951296182","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:56:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4671450-1842212951295729","game_id":"steam-4671450","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo — Opening Time Announcement","summary":"Hello, this is World of Slime. Thank you so much for your interest and support.World of Slime is scheduled to open between 3:00–4:00 AM Eastern Time (EDT, UTC-4).Please wait just a little longer!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-26T04:12:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951295729","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:56:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4671450-1841579228668694","game_id":"steam-4671450","kind":"announcement","title":"The World of Slime demo launches on August 26!","summary":"Your first chance to touch the soft, squishyslimes! On August 26, set off into the soft and squishy World of Slime on Steam.A laid-back adventure to enjoy with your friends — get ready to download the PC demo. Add the game to your Steam wishlist and you'll get notified the moment the demo goes live.Show the World of Slime demo some love!From TEAM42","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-21T13:04:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228668694","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:56:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4671450-1839676055887466","game_id":"steam-4671450","kind":"announcement","title":"Dev. Note Vol.3","summary":"Hey there, Adventurers!We are TEAM42, the devs behind the upcoming casual MMORPG, ‘World of Slime.’In our last Dev. Note, we introduced the Slimepedia, where every slime you meet gets recorded, and the Slime Knowledge that becomes real power on your journey.So what can you actually do with all those slimes logged in your Slimepedia?Today, we’re here to answer that! Let’s talk about Exploration with your slimes, and Slime Riding, which will carry you to places your own two feet could never reach.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-31T08:20:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055887466","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:56:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4671450-1838407329265199","game_id":"steam-4671450","kind":"announcement","title":"Dev. Note Vol.2","summary":"Hey there, Adventurers!We are TEAM42, the devs behind the upcoming casual MMORPG, ‘World of Slime.’In our last Dev. Note, we introduced \"Taming\" and \"Synthesis\", the two ways to meet your very own slimes.But where do all those slimes go once you meet them?Today, we’re here to answer that! Let’s talk about the Slimepedia, and how your growing \"Slime Knowledge\" becomes the ultimate power-up for your journey.Fill Up Your Slimepedia with Cute Slimes!When you tame a slime for the first time, a brand-","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-20T10:40:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329265199","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:56:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4671450-1836506165569797","game_id":"steam-4671450","kind":"announcement","title":"Dev. Note Vol.1","summary":"Hello, gamers!It is a great pleasure to meet you. We are TEAM42, currently developing the MMORPG World of Slime.Starting today, we would like to share our Dev. Notes from time to time to show you the thoughts and philosophy behind the development of World of Slime.Our very first story is about the two most fundamental actions in this game: “Taming” and “Synthesis.”In the World of Slime, there is a wide variety of Slimes waiting to be tamed!What is Taming? Some slimes are easily found in specific","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-03T07:50:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165569797","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:56:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4671450":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:18:16Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:18:15Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4671450":"2026-10-26T13:18:16Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4671450":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:18:15Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T13:18:15Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:18:15Z"},"4793900":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:18:16Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T13:18:16Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:18:16Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4671450","app_id":4671450,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:46Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"a1ddb1b2fb3e5fde5a9d9160acdca1636af29ccc8d176467cfb8b39733e97d1f","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"다양한 슬라임을 포획하고 함께 성장하는 캐주얼 MMORPG 입니다. 필드 포획, 합성, 낚시로 슬라임을 수집하고, 시간과 장소에 따라 새로운 개체를 발견하세요. 전투와 탐험, 퍼즐 해결까지 함께하는 슬라임들과 말랑쫀득한 모험을 떠나보세요.","publishers":[{"name":"TEAM42","creator_clan_account_id":46181658}],"developers":[{"name":"TEAM42","creator_clan_account_id":46181658}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1798704000,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_quarter"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"World of Slime DEMO trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1787708403","trailer